<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: PRESS DIGEST - Ivory Coast - Feb 6.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Ivory Coast - Feb 6.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>No Ivorian newspapers were published on Thursday, a public holiday after the Moslem fasting month vigil of the Night of Destiny.</p>
<p>($1=556 CFA francs) -- Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
